#: includes/woocommerce/class-product.php:419
msgid ""
"This will set how many days to skip before you allow your customer to choose "
"a date. 0 means starting from the same day, 1 means from tomorrow on and so "
"on. If you set a start date, the the start date will be considered as a "
"minimum starting date."
msgstr ""
"Определяет, сколько дней пропустить, прежде чем клиенту будет разрешено "
"выбрать дату. 0 — начиная с сегодняшнего дня, 1 — с завтрашнего дня и так "
"далее. Если задана начальная дата, она будет считаться минимальной начальной "
"датой."

#: backend.js:4934
msgctxt "label"
msgid ""
"All sellable products — event tickets, optional add-ons and fees — across "
"all lists plus global products without a list. An event ticket is the ticket "
"itself and is always sold, an optional add-on is chosen by the customer with "
"a checkbox, and a fee with auto-add sits on every order by default (e.g. a "
"pre-sale fee). Prices are gross — the assigned rate only documents the net "
"and tax split."
msgstr ""

